      "treatment_summary": "泼尼松、双氯芬酸、柳氮磺吡啶、英夫利西单抗 (prednisone, diclofenac, sulfasalazine, infliximab) with initial response; after 4 months recurrent fever and diarrhoea with intestinal perforation, anti-infliximab antibodies 1425.95 AU/mL and infliximab level <0.4 μg/mL; 肠造口术 (enterostomy); switched to 阿达木单抗、沙利度胺 (adalimumab, thalidomide) plus 硫唑嘌呤 (azathioprine); no fever, diarrhoea or joint swelling at 1.5-year follow-up, fecal calprotectin normal, still malnourished but growth improved",
