      "clinical_diagnosis_basis": "结合临床症状及基因检测结果: exome sequencing found no disease-related SNV or small indel; CNV analysis found heterozygous deletion of TNFAIP3 exons 2~9, verified by qPCR; symptoms 发热、口腔溃疡、肛周溃疡、腹泻、关节炎. Treatment was started on the basis of 早发白塞综合征样临床表现 (early-onset Behçet-like features)",
